Package: python3-pyfasm
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}
Description: Universal No-GIL & PyPy to pure FASM x64 native compiler
 PyFASM is a native cross-platform compiler translating Python (3.8-3.16,
 No-GIL 3.13t-3.16t, PyPy 3.8-3.12) directly to pure x86_64 Flat Assembler
 with true hardware multithreading for Linux ELF, Apple macOS, Windows PE64,
 DLL and MyOS 10.
